  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Check</strong> eight link depth on allies. Allies within vigilance have advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects. This lasts for one minute, or until your link breaks.</p><p><strong>Sustain:</strong> three link depth.</p><p><strong>Energize:</strong> Expend two link depth. Until Vigilance ends, spells have no effect on a successful save.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
